WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.253
Bird was looking for Kip.

2
00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:33.157
Kip was looking for Bird.

3
00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:49.794
Bird looked near the giant rock first.

4
00:00:49.795 --> 00:00:53.327
Then she looked near the playground.

5
00:00:53.328 --> 00:01:03.716
"Where is Kip?" she wondered.

6
00:01:03.717 --> 00:01:10.447
Kip looked near the playground first.

7
00:01:10.448 --> 00:01:19.354
Then he looked near the giant rock.

8
00:01:19.355 --> 00:01:30.447
"Where is Bird?" he wondered.

9
00:01:30.448 --> 00:01:36.254
Bird saw Mouse.

10
00:01:36.255 --> 00:01:40.423
"Have you seen Kip?" asked Bird.

11
00:01:40.424 --> 00:01:43.459
"Yes, I have," said Mouse.

12
00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:53.590
"I saw Kip near the giant rock."

13
00:01:53.591 --> 00:01:55.607
Kip saw Squirrel.

14
00:01:55.608 --> 00:01:58.652
"Have you seen Bird?" asked Kip.

15
00:01:58.653 --> 00:02:01.633
"Yes, I have," said Squirrel.

16
00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:07.115
"I saw Bird near the playground."

17
00:02:07.116 --> 00:02:11.789
Kip went back to the playground.

18
00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:20.189
He didn't see Bird.

19
00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:27.830
Bird went back to the giant rock.

20
00:02:27.831 --> 00:02:33.445
She didn't see Kip.

21
00:02:33.446 --> 00:02:38.644
"Oh well," said Kip.

22
00:02:38.645 --> 00:02:46.689
"I'll go to the aquarium by myself."

23
00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:50.726
"Oh well," said Bird.

24
00:02:50.727 --> 00:02:56.298
"I'll go to the aquarium by myself."
